# Byte-exact fixture copies of mpv-winbuild-cmake package files, used by
# test_pin_packages.py. They are kept pristine (no header comment inside the
# .cmake files) so the tests exercise pin_packages.py against exactly what a
# checkout at the pinned winbuild commit contains.
#
# Source: https://github.com/shinchiro/mpv-winbuild-cmake
# Commit: cd1edc11dc6887a50f705717619d879f5a93a488 (master tip, resolved
#         2026-09-01 via `git ls-remote ... refs/heads/master`; the same
#         commit versions.json pins as component mpv-winbuild-cmake)
# Fetched: 2026-09-01, raw.githubusercontent.com/<repo>/<commit>/packages/<f>
# (custom_steps.cmake, mingw-w64.cmake and llvm.cmake: same commit, cmake/,
# toolchain/ and toolchain/llvm/ respectively, copied from a verified local
# checkout at the pin 2026-09-01)
#
# sha256 of each fixture as fetched:
#   359c9c7da360f57d3a438e6fe117af6169cbd9aa3672751fd2bfc31e02be8fff  ffmpeg.cmake
#   41ec0c08160e4d0a31b2d9dc214985056ad9b61d77530c526ee77b0acc9c84b6  libass.cmake
#   c43469d77f50652718044e792b10f7db4ee378cb81949cdd3020e78b414083d6  mbedtls.cmake
#   cfb9b0fbaaf6013069fe3eeda7e9e9644546f09cd772dbd549f8eb7fa21c7122  mpv.cmake
#   b5dc88003f81d95e9a86c4befe1bac1472a4ec15c6d9a56a8bfd9c5fabf698a2  custom_steps.cmake
#   55f2a2bb49ef17de05985beb0395c7a1acb44d613c50e048fce1e5a2c2fab8a3  mingw-w64.cmake
#   a1168b87c9ef663c40ce08f666219e3f668efb328429e4cea8704741b8cb31db  llvm.cmake
#   4649b91fa340471263d52ef23fcd5dd0ff520dc60e91df564ce1059c4be27c9e  svtav1.cmake
#   ada268ec2e56867a085e66f491e4bdce80bc2ccf84e591ecef75030ee04cab9f  nvcodec-headers.cmake
#
# mpv/ffmpeg/libass are the files pin_packages.py rewrites (pristine upstream:
# no GIT_TAG, no GIT_RESET, no PATCH_COMMAND -- they track master).
# mingw-w64.cmake, llvm.cmake, svtav1.cmake and nvcodec-headers.cmake are the extra pinned packages
# (see pin_packages.EXTRA_COMPONENTS; mingw-w64 pristine has no GIT_TAG at
# all, llvm pristine carries upstream's own moving-branch GIT_TAG, which the
# rewrite replaces, and svtav1 tracks the default branch). ffmpeg.cmake is
# also the fixture for the aarch64 cuda gate rewrite.
# mbedtls.cmake is upstream's own pinning idiom and is the reference the tests
# compare the injected block's shape against; it is never rewritten.
# custom_steps.cmake carries the check-git step whose injection
# pin_packages.neutralize_check_git suppresses for warm-cache correctness; the
# tests assert the audited idiom still matches and that the rewrite converges.
#
# When bumping the mpv-winbuild-cmake pin in versions.json, refresh these
# nine fixtures from the new commit and update the hashes above.
